/button><button aria-label=\"Смени темата\" class=\"inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-muted-fg hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-moon h-4.5 w-4.5\"><path d=\"M12 3a6 6 0 0 0 9 9 9 9 0 1 1-9-9Z\"></path></svg></button><a class=\"hidden sm:block\" href=\"/login\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl font-semibold transition-all focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none active:scale-[0.98] border border-input bg-transparent hover:bg-muted h-9 px-3 text-sm\">Вход</button></a><button class=\"inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-foreground transition-colors hover:bg-muted lg:hidden\" aria-label=\"Меню\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu h-5 w-5\"><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></div></div></header><main class=\"flex-1\"><section class=\"relative isolate overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-900 to-emerald-950\" style=\"background-image: url(&quot;/images/services-loading.webp&quot;); background-size: cover; background-position: center center;\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-950/55 via-slate-950/25 to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 -z-10 h-28 bg-gradient-to-t from-background to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"container py-16 md:py-24\"><div class=\"max-w-xl rounded-3xl bg-slate-950/55 p-6 ring-1 ring-white/10 backdrop-blur-md sm:p-8\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><h1 class=\"font-display text-4xl font-extrabold leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-white md:text-5xl\">Услуги</h1><p class=\"mt-4 text-lg text-white/85\">Две посоки, доставка до офис на Еконт, минимум 10 кг / £20.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"container py-16 md:py-24 !pt-12\"><div class=\"grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"h-full\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><div class=\"flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card shadow-soft transition-shadow hover:shadow-lift\"><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br p-6 md:p-8 from-brand-50 to-card\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-brand/20 bg-card/70 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-brand-700 backdrop-blur\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-truck h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 18H9\"></path><path d=\"M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg> Manchester → BG</span><h2 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground\">Великобритания → България</h2><p class=\"mt-2 max-w-md text-sm text-muted-fg\">Седмичен курс със собствен бус от Манчестър до цяла България. Заявявате, носите колета в наш офис и ние се грижим за останалото.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-6 md:p-8 md:pt-6\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-muted-fg\">Включва</p><ul class=\"mt-4 space-y-4\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-house h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M15 21v-8a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v8\"></path><path d=\"M3 10a2 2 0 0 1 .709-1.528l7-5.999a2 2 0 0 1 2.582 0l7 5.999A2 2 0 0 1 21 10v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"min-w-0\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-bold text-foreground\">4 офиса за предаване в UK</span><span class=\"mt-0.5 block text-sm text-muted-fg\">Манчестър (2 офиса), Бърнли и Куинсфери — носите колета където ви е удобно.</span></span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-building2 h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M6 22V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v18Z\"></path><path d=\"M6 12H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2\"></path><path d=\"M18 9h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2\"></path><path d=\"M10 6h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 10h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 14h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 18h4\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"min-w-0\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-bold text-foreground\">До офис на Еконт</span><span class=\"mt-0.5 block text-sm text-muted-fg\">Получавате пратката от избран от вас офис на Еконт — навсякъде в България.</span></span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-banknote h-5 w-5\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"12\" x=\"2\" y=\"6\" rx=\"2\"></rect><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M6 12h.01M18 12h.01\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"min-w-0\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-bold text-foreground\">Плащане по банка или в офис</span><span class=\"mt-0.5 block text-sm text-muted-fg\">Плащане по банков път или на място в наш офис — просто и ясно.</span></span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-gift h-5 w-5\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"8\" width=\"18\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M12 8v13\"></path><path d=\"M19 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-7\"></path><path d=\"M7.5 8a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5A4.8 8 0 0 1 12 8a4.8 8 0 0 1 4.5-5 2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"min-w-0\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-bold text-foreground\">Подаръци и лични пратки</span><span class=\"mt-0.5 block text-sm text-muted-fg\">Подаръци и лични пратки за роднини — третирани с грижа.</span></span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-package h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M11 21.73a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73z\"></path><path d=\"M12 22V12\"></path><path d=\"m3.3 7 7.703 4.734a2 2 0 0 0 1.994 0L20.7 7\"></path><path d=\"m7.5 4.27 9 5.15\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"min-w-0\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-bold text-foreground\">Стоки с фактура</span><span class=\"mt-0.5 block text-sm text-muted-fg\">Търговски стоки с придружаваща фактура и документация.</span></span></li></ul><div class=\"mt-7 flex flex-col gap-2.5 pt-2 sm:flex-row\"><a class=\"block w-full\" href=\"/quote\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl font-semibold transition-all focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none active:scale-[0.98] bg-brand text-brand-fg hover:bg-brand-600 shadow-soft h-12 px-7 text-base w-full gap-2\">Изчисли цена <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"h-full\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><div class=\"flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card shadow-soft transition-shadow hover:shadow-lift\"><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br p-6 md:p-8 from-accent/10 to-card\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-brand/20 bg-card/70 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-brand-700 backdrop-blur\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-truck h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 18H9\"></path><path d=\"M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg> BG → Manchester</span><h2 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground\">България → Великобритания</h2><p class=\"mt-2 max-w-md text-sm text-muted-fg\">Изпращате багажа през който и да е офис на Еконт до нашия офис в Гоце Делчев — събираме всеки вторник и в петък багажът е в Манчестър.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col p-6 md:p-8 md:pt-6\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-muted-fg\">Включва</p><ul class=\"mt-4 space-y-4\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-send h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M14.536 21.686a.5.5 0 0 0 .937-.024l6.5-19a.496.496 0 0 0-.635-.635l-19 6.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.024.937l7.93 3.18a2 2 0 0 1 1.112 1.11z\"></path><path d=\"m21.854 2.147-10.94 10.939\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"min-w-0\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-bold text-foreground\">Изпращане през Еконт</span><span class=\"mt-0.5 block text-sm text-muted-fg\">От който и да е офис на Еконт — до нашия офис „Гоце Делчев — Панаирски ливади“, получател Богослав Хубенов.</span></span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar-days h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\